---
// /adhd — the message-matched door for the ADHD-first short-form video channel
// (decision 017 §2). Authorised by the owner 2026-08-21 and recorded in
// docs/decisions/021-the-adhd-door-is-a-demonstration-not-a-claim.md, which
// narrows the Q3 freeze for THIS PAGE ONLY.
//
// THE RULE THIS PAGE IS WRITTEN UNDER, from decision 021: every claim
// describes what the software does to a THOUGHT or a TASK — never what it does
// to a person or a condition. Under Australian therapeutic-goods rules, it is
// the ADVERTISING that establishes a product's intended purpose, so a sentence
// like "helps you manage your ADHD" would be an alleviation claim and could
// make BeFree a medical device under the Act. "Helps you remember to put the
// bins out" does not, even when the reader has ADHD.
//
// The quick test before you edit any line here: swap "ADHD" for "diabetes".
// If it suddenly sounds like a medical claim, it already was one.
//
// BANNED on this page: treat / manage / alleviate / relieve / reduce / improve
// / support / help with — applied to ADHD or any symptom; clinically proven,
// evidence-based, neuroscience-backed, designed by clinicians; any comparison
// to medication or therapy; symptom checklists; ADHD prevalence statistics used
// to set up the product as the answer; absolute outcome guarantees; and any
// testimonial, because no real permissioned one exists.
//
// NOT USED HERE, deliberately, though the home page carries it: "It makes sure
// it happens." That is an absolute outcome guarantee, our own Terms disclaim it
// ("always review what BeFree filed before relying on it"), and half of
// arms-length captures do not currently produce a filed item. Selling certainty
// to an audience recruited because things fall through is the one combination
// worth avoiding. See decision 021's open item.
//
// ADHD appears in the URL, the meta description and ONE acknowledgement line.
// It is deliberately absent from the <title>, the H1, the nav and the JSON-LD —
// those are the identity-led-brand surfaces Q3 still freezes.
import Site from '../layouts/Site.astro';
import BrainDumpDemo from '../components/BrainDumpDemo.astro';
import DownloadCTA from '../components/DownloadCTA.astro';
import StoreBadge from '../components/StoreBadge.astro';
---

<Site
  title="Your brain is louder than your to-do list — BeFree"
  description="Say the messy thing out loud and BeFree sorts it into tasks, reminders, events and lists, then brings each one back on time. The brain dump app a lot of people with ADHD end up using. Free on iPhone, Mac and the web."
  active="none"
>
  <!-- ══════════ HERO ══════════ -->
  <section class="hero">
    <div class="mascot">
      <img src="/assets/cutemic.png" alt="BeFree mascot" />
    </div>
    <h1>Your brain is louder<br /><span class="voice">than your to-do list.</span></h1>
    <p>
      Say the whole thing out loud — in one breath, in any order, half-finished. BeFree turns it
      into tasks, reminders, events, lists and notes, and brings each one back at the right moment.
    </p>
    <div class="hero-cta">
      <a href="https://app.heybefree.app" class="hero-start" data-get-befree>
        Get BeFree <i class="ph-bold ph-arrow-right"></i>
      </a>
    </div>
    <div class="hero-free">Free · no card</div>
  </section>

  <!-- ══════════ LIVE DEMO (reused verbatim) ══════════ -->
  <section id="try" class="demo-section">
    <div class="demo-title">
      Try it now — say it the way it actually comes out. <span class="live-badge">live</span>
    </div>
    <div class="demo-stage">
      <BrainDumpDemo />
    </div>
    <div class="trust-row">
      <span>Free to start</span>
      <span class="sep"></span>
      <span>Nothing saved</span>
      <span class="sep"></span>
      <span>Never trains on your words</span>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- ══════════ THE PILE OF HALF-FINISHED LISTS ══════════ -->
  <section class="band">
    <div class="section-head">
      <div class="eyebrow">If you've tried everything</div>
      <h2>The apps weren't the problem.<br />The setup was.</h2>
    </div>
    <div class="prose">
      <p>
        Every one of them wanted a project, a tag, a due date and a priority before it would hold a
        single thought. So the thought got dropped on the way, and the app became one more
        half-finished list you feel bad about opening.
      </p>
      <p>
        BeFree asks for none of that. You talk, it files. There's no board to build first, no system
        to maintain, and nothing that stops working because you left it alone for three weeks. If
        you never open a settings screen, nothing breaks.
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- ══════════ THE 2AM THING ══════════ -->
  <section class="band">
    <div class="section-head">
      <div class="eyebrow">The 2am thing</div>
      <h2>It never has to wait<br />for you to open an app.</h2>
    </div>
    <div class="prose">
      <p>
        The thought that arrives while you're falling asleep, mid-shower, or halfway through
        something else is the one that gets lost. By the time there's a phone in your hand and the
        right screen in front of you, it's gone.
      </p>
      <p>
        Say <strong>“Hey Siri, talk to BeFree”</strong> — Siri asks what's on your mind, BeFree sorts
        your answer and tells you where it went, without the app ever opening. There are mic and
        quick-type tiles on your Lock Screen, a widget on your Home Screen you can tick things off
        from, a hotkey on your Mac, and the whole app in any browser.
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- ══════════ IT LANDS WHERE YOU LOOK (reused verbatim from home) ══════════ -->
  <section class="lands">
    <div class="section-head">
      <div class="eyebrow">Not another inbox</div>
      <h2>It ends up where you<br />already look.</h2>
      <p class="section-sub">
        BeFree isn't a second system to keep checking. Flip on two-way sync and what you say lands
        in Apple Reminders and Apple Calendar — the right day, the right time, beside everything
        else in your life.
      </p>
    </div>
    <div class="lands-stage">
      <div class="lands-quote">
        <i class="ph-fill ph-quotes"></i>
        <span>“Grab Dad's prescription tomorrow at nine — oh, and lunch with Priya on Friday at one.”</span>
      </div>
      <div class="lands-arrow"><i class="ph-bold ph-arrow-down"></i></div>
      <div class="lands-rows">
        <div class="lands-row">
          <div class="lr-medal reminder"><i class="ph-bold ph-bell"></i></div>
          <div class="lr-text">
            <div class="lr-title">Grab Dad's prescription</div>
            <div class="lr-meta">Tomorrow · 9:00 AM</div>
          </div>
          <div class="lr-dest">→ Apple Reminders</div>
        </div>
        <div class="lands-row">
          <div class="lr-medal event"><i class="ph-bold ph-calendar-dots"></i></div>
          <div class="lr-text">
            <div class="lr-title">Lunch with Priya</div>
            <div class="lr-meta">Friday · 1:00 PM</div>
          </div>
          <div class="lr-dest">→ Apple Calendar</div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="lands-checks">
      <span class="lands-check"><i class="ph-bold ph-check"></i> Reads your iPhone's calendars — Google accounts included</span>
      <span class="lands-check"><i class="ph-bold ph-check"></i> Off until you switch it on — a switch per app, in Connections</span>
      <span class="lands-check"><i class="ph-bold ph-check"></i> Everything still syncs across iPhone, Mac &amp; web</span>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- ══════════ WHEN IT SLIPS ══════════ -->
  <!-- "Once a week" was drafted here and CUT: shelf_review_day defaults to
       'never' (settings-schema.ts), so nothing arrives weekly on a fresh
       install. The weekly nudge is named as the opt-in it actually is.
       "No counter climbing while you're not looking" was also cut — the web
       app's Insights view renders a "Current streak". The badge claim that
       survives is verified: shouldSetBadge:false is the only badge write. -->
  <section class="band">
    <div class="section-head">
      <div class="eyebrow">When it slips</div>
      <h2>Something slipped.<br />That's allowed.</h2>
    </div>
    <div class="prose">
      <p>
        Things fall through. BeFree doesn't turn that into a score — there's no red badge stacking
        up on the app icon, and no nagging.
      </p>
      <p>
        When something quietly passes, the Shelf holds it: the handful of things that slipped, one
        at a time, and one question — does this still matter? Move it to tonight, push it out, or
        let it go. <strong>Letting go is a real answer here, not a failed one</strong> — it closes
        the loop the same way finishing does. If you'd rather it came to you, pick a day and it'll
        bring them round weekly.
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- ══════════ IT STAYS QUIET ══════════ -->
  <section class="band">
    <div class="section-head">
      <div class="eyebrow">A room, not a lobby</div>
      <h2>Quiet unless you<br />asked it not to be.</h2>
    </div>
    <div class="prose">
      <p>
        Reminders arrive when you said they should, and nowhere else. Set quiet hours and anything
        due inside them waits until they're over instead of buzzing at midnight.
      </p>
      <p>
        Nothing here is built to pull you back in. There's no feed, no notification you didn't ask
        for, and no reason to open BeFree on a day you've got nothing to put down. Walking out and
        not thinking about it again is the app working, not you neglecting it.
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- ══════════ THE ACKNOWLEDGEMENT + DISCLAIMER ══════════ -->
  <!-- Placed IN the page, not the footer: decision 021 requires the
       not-a-medical-device line be visible without hunting for it.
       "Designed with the ADHD community" was drafted and CUT — nothing in the
       repo records that any such consultation happened, so it would be an
       unverifiable claim about ourselves. It can be added if and when it's
       true. -->
  <section class="plainly">
    <div class="plainly-inner">
      <p class="plainly-lead">
        A lot of the people who find BeFree have ADHD. It wasn't built to be an ADHD app and it
        isn't one — it's a brain dump app that happens to ask nothing of you up front, which turns
        out to be the part that matters.
      </p>
      <p class="plainly-fine">
        It is a productivity app, not a medical device. It does not diagnose, treat, cure or prevent
        any medical condition, and it is not a substitute for professional advice.
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- ══════════ VOICE MOMENT ══════════ -->
  <section class="voice-moment">
    <i class="ph-fill ph-quotes"></i>
    <p>Put it all down. Walk out lighter.</p>
  </section>

  <!-- ══════════ DOWNLOAD CTA ══════════ -->
  <DownloadCTA
    title="Put it down."
    sub="Say the first messy thing and see where it lands. Free on iPhone, Mac and the web — no card to start."
    meta="Free · iPhone, Mac &amp; browser"
  >
    <a href="https://app.heybefree.app" class="web-cta primary-web">
      <i class="ph-bold ph-globe"></i> Start free in your browser
    </a>
    <StoreBadge store="ios" />
    <StoreBadge store="mac" />
    <a href="/android" class="web-cta">
      <i class="ph-bold ph-android-logo"></i> Android early access
    </a>
  </DownloadCTA>
</Site>

<style>
  .eyebrow {
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    font-size: 12px;
    letter-spacing: 2.5px;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    color: var(--brass-deep);
    margin-bottom: 16px;
  }

  /* hero — same anatomy as the home hero: one message, one CTA */
  .hero {
    max-width: 900px;
    margin: 0 auto;
    padding: clamp(34px, 6vh, 74px) clamp(18px, 4vw, 40px) clamp(20px, 3vh, 34px);
    text-align: center;
  }
  .mascot {
    width: 104px;
    height: 104px;
    margin: 0 auto clamp(16px, 2.5vh, 24px);
    animation: bfBreathe 4200ms cubic-bezier(0.65, 0, 0.35, 1) infinite;
    filter: drop-shadow(0 16px 22px rgba(31, 26, 20, 0.18));
    will-change: transform;
  }
  .mascot img {
    width: 100%;
    height: 100%;
    object-fit: contain;
    display: block;
  }
  .hero h1 {
    font-family: var(--font-display);
    font-weight: 700;
    font-size: clamp(36px, 6.6vw, 68px);
    line-height: 1.02;
    letter-spacing: -2px;
    color: var(--text);
    margin: 0;
    text-wrap: balance;
  }
  .hero .voice {
    font-style: italic;
    font-weight: 600;
    color: var(--accent);
  }
  .hero p {
    font-family: var(--font-body);
    font-size: clamp(18px, 2.4vw, 22px);
    line-height: 1.5;
    color: var(--text-secondary);
    margin: clamp(16px, 2.5vh, 24px) auto 0;
    max-width: 620px;
    text-wrap: pretty;
  }
  .hero-cta {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    gap: 18px;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    margin-top: clamp(22px, 3.2vh, 32px);
  }
  .hero-start {
    text-decoration: none;
    display: inline-flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 10px;
    background: var(--accent);
    color: var(--on-accent);
    font-family: var(--font-display);
    font-weight: 600;
    font-size: 18px;
    padding: 15px 28px;
    border-radius: var(--radius-input);
    box-shadow: var(--elev-2);
    transition:
      transform 0.15s,
      box-shadow 0.15s;
  }
  .hero-start:hover {
    transform: translateY(-2px);
    box-shadow: var(--elev-3);
  }
  .hero-start i {
    font-size: 18px;
    transition: transform 0.15s;
  }
  .hero-start:hover i {
    transform: translateX(3px);
  }
  .hero-free {
    margin-top: 12px;
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    font-size: 11px;
    letter-spacing: 1.5px;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    color: var(--text-muted);
  }

  /* demo — identical to home */
  .demo-section {
    max-width: 800px;
    margin: 0 auto;
    padding: 0 clamp(16px, 4vw, 40px) clamp(16px, 3vh, 28px);
  }
  .demo-title {
    text-align: center;
    margin-bottom: 16px;
    font-family: var(--font-display);
    font-style: italic;
    font-weight: 600;
    font-size: clamp(19px, 2.6vw, 25px);
    color: var(--text);
  }
  .live-badge {
    font-style: normal;
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    font-size: 12px;
    letter-spacing: 1.5px;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    color: var(--accent);
    vertical-align: middle;
    background: var(--accent-subtle);
    padding: 4px 9px;
    border-radius: var(--radius-badge);
  }
  .demo-stage {
    background: var(--accent-subtle);
    border: 1px solid var(--border-subtle);
    border-radius: var(--radius-sheet);
    padding: clamp(14px, 2.5vw, 24px);
    box-shadow: var(--elev-3);
  }
  .trust-row {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    gap: 18px;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    margin-top: 18px;
    font-family: var(--font-body);
    font-size: 14px;
    color: var(--text-muted);
  }
  .sep {
    width: 4px;
    height: 4px;
    border-radius: 50%;
    background: var(--border-strong);
  }

  /* section heads */
  .section-head {
    text-align: center;
    margin-bottom: clamp(22px, 3.5vh, 36px);
  }
  .section-head .eyebrow {
    margin-bottom: 12px;
  }
  .section-head h2 {
    font-family: var(--font-display);
    font-weight: 700;
    font-size: clamp(30px, 4.6vw, 46px);
    line-height: 1.05;
    letter-spacing: -1px;
    color: var(--text);
    margin: 0;
    text-wrap: balance;
  }
  .section-sub {
    font-family: var(--font-body);
    font-size: clamp(16px, 2vw, 19px);
    line-height: 1.5;
    color: var(--text-secondary);
    margin: 14px auto 0;
    max-width: 560px;
  }

  /* prose bands */
  .band {
    max-width: 1140px;
    margin: 0 auto;
    padding: clamp(40px, 6vh, 80px) clamp(18px, 4vw, 40px);
  }
  .prose {
    max-width: 620px;
    margin: 0 auto;
  }
  .prose p {
    font-family: var(--font-body);
    font-size: clamp(16px, 2vw, 18px);
    line-height: 1.6;
    color: var(--text-secondary);
    margin: 0 0 16px;
    text-wrap: pretty;
  }
  .prose p:last-child {
    margin-bottom: 0;
  }
  .prose strong {
    color: var(--text);
    font-weight: 600;
  }

  /* lands — same as home */
  .lands {
    max-width: 1140px;
    margin: 0 auto;
    padding: clamp(40px, 6vh, 80px) clamp(18px, 4vw, 40px) clamp(24px, 4vh, 44px);
  }
  .lands-stage {
    max-width: 680px;
    margin: 0 auto;
    background: var(--bg-card);
    border: 1px solid var(--border-subtle);
    border-radius: var(--radius-sheet);
    box-shadow: var(--elev-2);
    padding: clamp(22px, 4vw, 36px);
  }
  .lands-quote {
    display: flex;
    gap: 12px;
    align-items: flex-start;
    font-family: var(--font-display);
    font-style: italic;
    font-weight: 600;
    font-size: clamp(17px, 2.4vw, 21px);
    line-height: 1.45;
    color: var(--text);
  }
  .lands-quote i {
    color: var(--accent);
    font-size: 22px;
    flex: none;
    margin-top: 2px;
  }
  .lands-arrow {
    text-align: center;
    margin: 14px 0;
    color: var(--text-muted);
    font-size: 18px;
  }
  .lands-rows {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 10px;
  }
  .lands-row {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    gap: 13px;
    background: var(--bg);
    border: 1px solid var(--border-subtle);
    border-radius: var(--radius-card);
    padding: 13px 16px;
  }
  .lr-medal {
    width: 40px;
    height: 40px;
    border-radius: var(--radius-input);
    display: grid;
    place-items: center;
    flex: none;
  }
  .lr-medal i {
    font-size: 20px;
  }
  .lr-medal.reminder {
    background: color-mix(in srgb, var(--tool-reminder) 14%, transparent);
  }
  .lr-medal.reminder i {
    color: var(--tool-reminder);
  }
  .lr-medal.event {
    background: color-mix(in srgb, var(--tool-event) 14%, transparent);
  }
  .lr-medal.event i {
    color: var(--tool-event);
  }
  .lr-text {
    flex: 1;
    min-width: 160px;
  }
  .lr-title {
    font-family: var(--font-display);
    font-weight: 600;
    font-size: 16px;
    color: var(--text);
  }
  .lr-meta {
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    font-size: 11.5px;
    color: var(--text-muted);
    margin-top: 2px;
  }
  .lr-dest {
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    font-size: 11px;
    letter-spacing: 0.5px;
    color: var(--brass-deep);
    white-space: nowrap;
  }
  .lands-checks {
    display: flex;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    justify-content: center;
    gap: 10px 22px;
    margin-top: 22px;
  }
  .lands-check {
    display: inline-flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 8px;
    font-family: var(--font-body);
    font-size: 14px;
    color: var(--text-secondary);
  }
  .lands-check i {
    color: var(--tool-grocery);
    font-size: 15px;
    flex: none;
  }

  /* acknowledgement + disclaimer */
  .plainly {
    max-width: 1140px;
    margin: 0 auto;
    padding: clamp(20px, 3vh, 36px) clamp(18px, 4vw, 40px);
  }
  .plainly-inner {
    max-width: 640px;
    margin: 0 auto;
    background: var(--bg-subtle);
    border: 1px solid var(--border-subtle);
    border-radius: var(--radius-card);
    padding: clamp(22px, 3.5vw, 32px);
    text-align: center;
  }
  .plainly-lead {
    font-family: var(--font-body);
    font-size: 16px;
    line-height: 1.6;
    color: var(--text-secondary);
    margin: 0 0 12px;
    text-wrap: pretty;
  }
  .plainly-fine {
    font-family: var(--font-body);
    font-size: 13.5px;
    line-height: 1.55;
    color: var(--text-muted);
    margin: 0;
    text-wrap: pretty;
  }

  /* voice moment */
  .voice-moment {
    max-width: 820px;
    margin: 0 auto;
    padding: clamp(30px, 5vh, 60px) clamp(18px, 4vw, 40px);
    text-align: center;
  }
  .voice-moment i {
    font-size: 48px;
    color: var(--border-strong);
  }
  .voice-moment p {
    font-family: var(--font-display);
    font-style: italic;
    font-weight: 600;
    font-size: clamp(24px, 3.6vw, 38px);
    line-height: 1.3;
    letter-spacing: -0.4px;
    color: var(--text);
    margin: 14px 0 0;
    text-wrap: balance;
  }

  /* browser-app CTA inside the dark download panel */
  .web-cta {
    text-decoration: none;
    display: inline-flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 10px;
    background: transparent;
    border: 1.5px solid #4a4130;
    color: #f2ead6;
    padding: 15px 24px;
    border-radius: 14px;
    font-family: var(--font-display);
    font-weight: 600;
    font-size: 16px;
  }
  .web-cta:hover {
    border-color: #b583be;
    color: #e6c7ed;
  }
  .web-cta i {
    font-size: 18px;
  }
  .web-cta.primary-web {
    background: var(--accent);
    border-color: var(--accent);
    color: var(--on-accent);
  }
  .web-cta.primary-web:hover {
    border-color: var(--accent);
    color: var(--on-accent);
    transform: translateY(-2px);
    box-shadow: var(--elev-2);
  }
</style>
